      "content": "datasets:\n  nslkdd:\n    train_url: \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/defcom17/NSL_KDD/master/KDDTrain+.txt\"\n    test_url: \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/defcom17/NSL_KDD/master/KDDTest+.txt\"\n    train_file: \"data/raw/KDDTrain+.txt\"\n    test_file: \"data/raw/KDDTest+.txt\"\n    input_dim: 41\n    num_classes: 5\n    class_names: [\"Normal\", \"DoS\", \"Probe\", \"R2L\", \"U2R\"]\n\n  unswnb15:\n    train_file: \"data/raw/UNSW_NB15_training-set.csv\"\n    test_file: \"data/raw/UNSW_NB15_testing-set.csv\"\n    input_dim: 49\n    num_classes: 10\n\n  ciciot2023:\n    # CIC-IoT-2023 (Neto et al. 2023) ships as ~169 per-scenario CSV shards;\n    # concatenate and split them into these two files before running\n    # experiments -- see data/preprocessing/ciciot2023_pipeline.py docstring.\n    train_file: \"data/raw/CICIoT2023_train.csv\"\n    test_file: \"data/raw/CICIoT2023_test.csv\"\n    input_dim: 46\n    num_classes: 8\n    class_names: [\"Benign\", \"DDoS\", \"DoS\", \"Recon\", \"WebBased\", \"BruteForce\", \"Spoofing\", \"Mirai\"]\n\n  mnist:\n    data_root: \"data/raw/mnist\"\n    input_dim: 784\n    num_classes: 10\n\npartitioning:\n  iid:\n    type: \"iid\"\n  noniid_moderate:\n    type: \"noniid\"\n    alpha: 0.5\n  noniid_stress:\n    type: \"noniid\"\n    alpha: 0.1\n\nserver:\n  val_size: 2000\n  val_stratified: true\n  root_dataset_fraction: 0.02\n"
